{"ID":"20240314092114-ejcscv7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092114-ejcscv7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092114-ejcscv7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161936-rnpybtp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161936-rzlv1gm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:73,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161936-rzlv1gm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:143,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:143\u0026#125;","title":"【大建中汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161936-rnpybtp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-rnpybtp","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心胸中大寒痛，呕不能饮食，腹中满，上冲皮起，出见有头"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"足，上下痛不可触近者，大建中汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-4yuz6ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-4yuz6ua","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大建中汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-t0rifuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-t0rifuo","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀椒二合炒去汗，干姜一两，人参二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-ejq3gr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-ejq3gr7","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味以水四升，煮取二升，去滓内胶饴一升，微火煎取一升，分温再服；如一炊顷可饮粥二升，后更服，当一日食糜温覆之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-xxyrmm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-xxyrmm7","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下面这个处方跟附子粳米汤一样，非常好使用个处方，2 个月前的时候，我接到一个加州研究美与学的博士，很年轻的一个中国人。他大概看了我的网页哦。就写了一个传真给我，临床看病嘛，他说，他把台大医院也骂一遍，什么烂台大医院啊。我这个肚子哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"出见有头足，肚子里面可以看到头足，可以看到肠子在那里蠕动，痛得要死"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我都可以看到它们在这里动来动去。我跑到台大，看遍台大的医生都不好啊，真烂！你讲的没错，看病都看不好，医院又开那么大！还自以为了不起。他在讲这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上冲皮起，出见有头足，我给他一看，大建中汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，已经结束了，很简单。我没有看过他嘛。他写的很好，我就开个处方，寄药给他。一剂就止了，从此没有回来了，为什么？因为好了嘛。这就是大建中汤。我们休息一下，等会儿回来介绍大建中汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-rs8sid9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-rs8sid9","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240325174529-fuio6xo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-lemu8v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-lemu8v4","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来呢，我们要介绍大建中汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大小建中汤不太一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小建中汤呢，是少腹寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以说，如果人的身体是这样，肚脐在这边，肚子以下寒痛就是小建中汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大建中汤呢，中焦这边的寒，比较重的寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是胸口，胸的寒痛，就是我们的乌头赤石脂丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是因为有寒淤在里面，那由于是中焦胃的地方。诸位看哦，蜀椒呢，二个汤匙，平匙，炒，炒熟，去汗的意思呢，看它烟冒出来，生的变成熟的而已。干姜 1 钱，人参 2 钱，蜀椒，干姜、人参，三味药而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-8ftgydo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-8ftgydo","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀椒干姜这两味药我们同时在做乌头赤石脂丸的时候也会用到，因为它能去它的寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。同时蜀椒呢除了腥香，而且是辣的，除了杀虫以外，我们的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大建中汤也可以用来治虫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦。胆道有蛔虫堵道的时候，看起来时是大建中汤症，我们还是可以用大建中汤哦。那这个蜀椒除了杀虫以外，还有痰饮啊，寒湿通通可以去。干姜呢，温中。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-5z06s2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-5z06s2x","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这三味药呢，煮呢，用四碗水煮成两碗水。把蜀椒干姜人参去掉之后，再放麦芽糖，麦芽糖一碗，两个再混在一起煮，再煮成一碗。然后呢，分开两次吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-vfwggg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-vfwggg7","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个大建中汤，各位看主要的症状，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大寒痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，特别强调这个寒来的很剧烈。如果是少腹的寒痛，小肠套叠在一起，我们刚刚也介绍过，附子粳米汤。对不对？小建中汤，这种寒呢，是小意思，不治也没有关系，肚子打两下，我们练功夫嘛，敲敲肚子，我们前面也介绍过如何敲肚子，肠子也可以恢复。那真正少腹大寒痛的时候，雷鸣切痛的时候，我们使用这个附子粳米汤，这种都很严重的比较严重的痛，呕，因为胃里面太冷了，恶心，东西吃下。吐掉，腹里面又胀满，因为这个堵到中间的时候，上下不能衔接，肚子呢坑到了哦，所以会有中满的现象、气胀的现象。这个时候呢，因为里面寒，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上冲皮起，出见有头足"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么看到有头足呢？实际上就是肠胃在蠕动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有动脉脉搏在底下，腹部的动脉可以蠕动，你可以看到肚子在动啊，真的是看到肚子在动，就会有这种症状。但是呢，他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是因为寒很盛，东西吃下去又吐掉，上下又不能衔接，因为中焦是很寒很盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个呢“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上下痛不可近触"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，碰都不能碰，这个是大陷胸汤，而病人跟你呈述的时候，或者你看病人，肚子一拉起来一看的时候，肚子你可以看到好像有东西长在里面，有头足的现象。那大建中汤速度非常的快，跟这个附子粳米汤一样，这个速度非常的快，是大寒痛的时候，所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有寒有深有浅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161936-rzlv1gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161936-rzlv1gm","updated":"20240422161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像这种处方，如果说呕不能食，肚子不能哦......如果我们把蜀椒拿掉，如果把它换成半夏，半夏能够止呕，去水吐利，干姜温中，然后人参，像妇人呢、女孩子、这个太太，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕的时候，呕吐的很厉害的话，人参半夏干姜汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你把蜀椒拿掉，换成半夏，这种都是就是马上就可以一剂就可以知道的，效果非常好。"}]}]}